[Desktop Entry]
Name=Multi-Seat Manager
Name[es]=Gestor Multi-Seat
GenericName=Seat Manager
GenericName[es]=Gestor de Asientos Múltiples
Comment=Manage peripherals, seat profiles and the display manager for Multi-Seat
Comment[es]=Administra periféricos, perfiles de asiento y gestor de inicio para Multi-Seat
